s, excellent spatial vision, very good leadership qualities. Concerns: unfriendly, eats unhealthily, show-off, not open to new ideas, occasional disorganization. We can say we still recommend A but we need to verify stress resilience and health impact. So vote remains Candidate A.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: \"I agree with the consensus that Candidate A remains the leading option. While we have strong evidence of his anticipation, spatial vision, leadership, we must still address concerns about his unfriendly demeanor, unhealthy eating, and lack of openness to feedback, and we need evidence of stress resilience. However, compared to the other candidates' more severe interpersonal issues, A still appears the best fit. I maintain my provisional vote for A.\"\n\nMETADATA_JSON: {\"agent\":\"agent_3\",\"vote\":\"Candidate A\"}\n\nProceed."}
